---
import ResponsiveImage from '../components/ResponsiveImage.astro';import {photos} from '../data/properties';import {landscapes} from '../data/landscapes';
---
<section class="experience-section section"><div class="container experience-layout"><div class="experience-photo" data-reveal><ResponsiveImage photo={landscapes.lake}/><span class="photo-place">New Zealand · Lakeside</span></div><div class="experience-copy"><h2 class="display">A little room<br>to <em>slow down.</em></h2><h3>给日常，留一点从容。</h3><p>把城市作为起点，把山海留给旅途。<br>从容的旅居，从一个舒适的落脚处开始。</p><a class="text-link" href="/experience/">探索旅居体验</a><div class="experience-detail"><ResponsiveImage photo={photos.room2[1]} sizes="(max-width:760px) 65vw, 30vw"/><small>让用餐与生活，都在自己的步调里。</small></div></div></div></section>
